 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Proposed",
   "texto": [
    "**давай + verbo en primera persona del plural**: **Давай пойдём в кино** is used to propose a plan informally. **Что ты предлагаешь?** means «What do you propose?». **Свободен** is the masculine and **свободна** form, the feminine. **Пригласить** is perfect and presents a specific invitation; the perfect aspect does not by itself mean «only once».",
    "To accept: **Договорились!** (All right! / We are left!). **Хорошо!** also means «Okay!»."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Reject with education",
   "texto": [
    "**К сожалению** (Unfortunately) + **не могу** (I cannot) allow you to reject an invitation with courtesy: **К сожалению, я не могу**. **Может быть** means «Maybe.» and leaves the answer open. **Никуда** means «nowhere.»: **Я никуда не иду** (I'm not going anywhere).",
    "In **Спасибо за приглашение** (thanks for the invitation), **за** is followed by the accusative; **приглашение** has here the same form as in nominative."
   ]
